              "id": "teacher",
              "text": "Only teachers use 吗"
            },
            {
              "id": "what",
              "text": "什么 already asks “what”"
            }
          ],
          "answer": "what",
          "explanation": "吗 creates a yes-or-no question; 什么 already asks for the missing information.",
          "hint": "What kind of answer does “what is your name?” request?"
